{"seq":2,"slug":"package-json-in-depth","title":"深入 package.json","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/package-management/package-json-in-depth","wordCount":969,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"深入-package-json\">深入 package.json</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>package.json 是 Node.js 项目的契约文件，它同时承担四种角色：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>元数据载体</strong>：name、version、description、license 等字段，决定包在 Registry 中的身份与可发现性。</li>\n<li><strong>入口映射</strong>：<code>main</code>/<code>module</code>/<code>types</code> 是传统入口，<code>exports</code> 是 Node.js 12+ 的现代标准——它同时提供条件导出（import/require 分流）和真正的封装性（未列出的路径对外不可见）。</li>\n<li><strong>依赖声明</strong>：<code>dependencies</code>/<code>devDependencies</code> 的划分标准是&quot;代码是否在运行时执行&quot;；<code>peerDependencies</code> 声明宿主必须提供的依赖；<code>overrides</code> 强制覆盖嵌套版本。</li>\n<li><strong>生命周期挂载点</strong>：<code>scripts</code> 中的 <code>preinstall</code>/<code>prepare</code>/<code>prepublishOnly</code> 等钩子把构建、测试、发布流程自动化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解这四种角色的边界，是编写高质量 npm 包的基础。其中最容易被忽视的是 <code>exports</code>——一旦它存在，未列出的内部文件就自动对外封闭。</p>\n<h2 id=\"package-json-的角色\">package.json 的角色</h2><p>package.json 是每个 Node.js 项目的核心配置文件。它不仅描述了项目的基本信息和依赖关系，还定义了入口点、脚本命令、导出映射等关键配置。一个精心配置的 package.json 是高质量 npm 包的基础。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基础字段\">基础字段</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@scope/my-package&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;1.2.3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;description&quot;: &quot;一个优秀的 Node.js 工具库&quot;,&#10;  &quot;keywords&quot;: [&quot;nodejs&quot;, &quot;utility&quot;, &quot;tools&quot;],&#10;  &quot;license&quot;: &quot;MIT&quot;,&#10;  &quot;author&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;name&quot;: &quot;张三&quot;,&#10;    &quot;email&quot;: &quot;zhangsan@example.com&quot;,&#10;    &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://zhangsan.dev&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;repository&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;git&quot;,&#10;    &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://github.com/user/my-package.git&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;bugs&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://github.com/user/my-package/issues&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;homepage&quot;: &quot;https://my-package.dev&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@scope/my-package\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.2.3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"一个优秀的 Node.js 工具库\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"keywords\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"nodejs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"utility\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tools\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"license\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MIT\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"author\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"张三\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"zhangsan@example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://zhangsan.dev\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"repository\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"git\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://github.com/user/my-package.git\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"bugs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://github.com/user/my-package/issues\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"homepage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://my-package.dev\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>必填</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>name</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>包名，可带 @scope 前缀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>version</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>语义化版本号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>description</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n<td>简短描述，影响 npm 搜索结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>keywords</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n<td>关键词数组，影响搜索排名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>license</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n<td>开源许可证标识符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>author</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n<td>作者信息（字符串或对象）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"入口点配置\">入口点配置</h2><h3 id=\"main-module-和-types\">main、module 和 types</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;main&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.cjs&quot;,&#10;  &quot;module&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.mjs&quot;,&#10;  &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.d.ts&quot;,&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;module&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"main\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.cjs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.mjs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.d.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"module\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>消费者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>main</td>\n<td>CommonJS 入口</td>\n<td>require() 调用时使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>module</td>\n<td>ESM 入口（非官方）</td>\n<td>打包工具（webpack、rollup）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>types</td>\n<td>TypeScript 类型声明入口</td>\n<td>TypeScript 编译器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>type</td>\n<td>模块类型声明</td>\n<td>Node.js 运行时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"exports-现代入口映射\">exports —— 现代入口映射</h3><p><code>exports</code> 字段是 Node.js 12+ 引入的模块入口映射机制，它比 <code>main</code> 更强大、更精确：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;exports&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;.&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;import&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.d.mts&quot;,&#10;        &quot;default&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.mjs&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;require&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.d.cts&quot;,&#10;        &quot;default&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.cjs&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;./utils&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;import&quot;: &quot;./dist/utils.mjs&quot;,&#10;      &quot;require&quot;: &quot;./dist/utils.cjs&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;./package.json&quot;: &quot;./package.json&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exports\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \".\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"import\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.d.mts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.mjs\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"require\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.d.cts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.cjs\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"./utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"import\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/utils.mjs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"require\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/utils.cjs\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"./package.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./package.json\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    CONSUMER[消费者代码] --&gt; IMPORT{导入方式?}&#10;    IMPORT --&gt;|import from &#39;pkg&#39;| ESM[exports . import]&#10;    IMPORT --&gt;|require &#39;pkg&#39;| CJS[exports . require]&#10;    IMPORT --&gt;|import from &#39;pkg/utils&#39;| SUB[exports ./utils]&#10;    ESM --&gt; TYPES_ESM[types → .d.mts]&#10;    ESM --&gt; DEFAULT_ESM[default → .mjs]&#10;    CJS --&gt; TYPES_CJS[types → .d.cts]&#10;    CJS --&gt; DEFAULT_CJS[default → .cjs]\">flowchart TD\n    CONSUMER[消费者代码] --&gt; IMPORT{导入方式?}\n    IMPORT --&gt;|import from 'pkg'| ESM[exports . import]\n    IMPORT --&gt;|require 'pkg'| CJS[exports . require]\n    IMPORT --&gt;|import from 'pkg/utils'| SUB[exports ./utils]\n    ESM --&gt; TYPES_ESM[types → .d.mts]\n    ESM --&gt; DEFAULT_ESM[default → .mjs]\n    CJS --&gt; TYPES_CJS[types → .d.cts]\n    CJS --&gt; DEFAULT_CJS[default → .cjs]</pre><p><strong>重要规则</strong>：当 <code>exports</code> 存在时，只有 <code>exports</code> 中明确列出的路径可以被外部导入。未列出的路径（如内部实现文件）对外不可见——这提供了真正的封装性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"imports-内部路径映射\">imports —— 内部路径映射</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;imports&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;#config&quot;: &quot;./src/config.ts&quot;,&#10;    &quot;#utils/*&quot;: &quot;./src/utils/*.ts&quot;,&#10;    &quot;#db&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;development&quot;: &quot;./src/db/sqlite.ts&quot;,&#10;      &quot;production&quot;: &quot;./src/db/postgres.ts&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"imports\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"#config\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/config.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"#utils/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/utils/*.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"#db\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"development\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/db/sqlite.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./src/db/postgres.ts\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { loadConfig } from &#39;#config&#39;;&#10;import { formatDate } from &#39;#utils/date&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">